      "side": 1,
      "message": "The change from fmt.Sprintf to hex.EncodeToString is reasonable, but I just want to point out if the only motivation to do it was to remove the \"fmt\" import, that\u0027s not necessary since this is a _test.go file. Also, the \"fmt\" package is still imported via \"testing\" (see https://cs.opensource.google/go/go/+/master:src/testing/testing.go;l\u003d346;drc\u003dde9805c702bcc19bcf3c783d1c2e43fdf4e1d30e).",
      "revId": "4f36628a4a57fdf585bc875ec99240dd73af8bed",
