        "id": 6005
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-06-21T21:41:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To clarify, the reason we don\u0027t need to worry about imports in the _test.go file is because only the normal package is vendored into the standard library and checked for imports as described in the initial comment of #48154. Its tests are out of scope, and are allowed to import more packages during testing.",
      "parentUuid": "44a754f4_c28830f5",
      "revId": "4f36628a4a57fdf585bc875ec99240dd73af8bed",
